# 6. COMPLETE ROLE AND PERMISSION SYSTEM

The system must support role-based access control with optional fine-grained permission overrides.

## 6.1 Default roles

### Platform Administrator

Operates the overall KANAK platform.

May administer company registration requests, activation codes and platform security.

Does not automatically gain unrestricted access to private customer business records without an explicit support-access policy and auditable authorization.

### Business Owner

Full administrative access to their own business.

Cannot access another business unless separately authorized there.

### Manager

Operational administrator with explicitly delegated permissions.

Can manage inventory, products or sales depending on business policy.

### Salesperson

Limited operational user primarily responsible for van sales.

Can create customers, sell products, issue invoices and print receipts within their assigned scope.

Cannot perform restricted administrative actions unless the owner explicitly grants them.

